  "description": "Red listed Grey Partridge ( Perdix perdix )calling. Very quiet rural area in Dutch polder on summer evening. All sounds far. Insects, crickets, voice, traffic. \nPartridges are medium-sized birds, generally intermediate in size between the larger pheasants, smaller quail; they're ground-dwelling birds that feature variable plumage colouration across species, with most tending to grey and brown. In the Netherlands the like to live, like here, on agricultural land.\n<a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Polder_Hedikhuizen_op_avond_in_juni_2022_07.jpg\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Polder Hedikhuizen op avond in juni 2022 07\" src=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e4/Polder_Hedikhuizen_op_avond_in_juni_2022_07.jpg/512px-Polder_Hedikhuizen_op_avond_in_juni_2022_07.jpg\"></a>\n <a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Polder_Hedikhuizen_op_avond_in_juni_2022_01.jpg\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Polder Hedikhuizen op avond in juni 2022 01\" src=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/79/Polder_Hedikhuizen_op_avond_in_juni_2022_01.jpg/256px-Polder_Hedikhuizen_op_avond_in_juni_2022_01.jpg\"></a> <a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Polder_Hedikhuizen_op_avond_in_juni_2022_03.jpg\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Polder Hedikhuizen op avond in juni 2022 03\" src=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/34/Polder_Hedikhuizen_op_avond_in_juni_2022_03.jpg/256px-Polder_Hedikhuizen_op_avond_in_juni_2022_03.jpg\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:075_-_GRAY_PARTRIDGE_(6-9-2018)_grand_forks_co,_nd_-15_(42016898344).jpg\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"075 - GRAY PARTRIDGE (6-9-2018) grand forks co, nd -15 (42016898344)\" src=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8c/075_-_GRAY_PARTRIDGE_%286-9-2018%29_grand_forks_co%2C_nd_-15_%2842016898344%29.jpg/128px-075_-_GRAY_PARTRIDGE_%286-9-2018%29_grand_forks_co%2C_nd_-15_%2842016898344%29.jpg\"></a>\n\